  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "459d2b239478bd71",
      "translationZh": "大家好，我一直在开发一个开源 LLM 开发仓库。任何人都可以基于任意架构（GQA、MLA、Dense...）训练任意参数量的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0986cfc4d16fc2e",
      "translationZh": "当我尝试实现 MLA 时，我阅读了关于 deepseek 实现的技术研究论文，发现他们使用 FlashMLA 来进行快速训练和推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fbc482a49d71d6e",
      "translationZh": "唯一的问题是，它只针对 sm_100 和 sm_90 编译，而我找不到任何人尝试为消费级 blackwell sm_120 构建它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97e582ad5723cc69",
      "translationZh": "https://github.com/IISuperluminaLII/FlashMLA_Windows_Linux_sm120 *我不太擅长起名字",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d91e7214ceef182f",
      "translationZh": "FlashMLA 与 PyTorch SDPA 的基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79ee54eae05bb19e",
      "translationZh": "工作负载 FlashMLA SDPA 加速比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a04e2d64a0f2cd5",
      "translationZh": "稀疏 FP8 解码 — b=128 , s_q=2 , topk=2048",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a093bcce1b2d131",
      "translationZh": "2.118 ms（收集 + 数学运算）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36c54815889c9f55",
      "translationZh": "稀疏推理服务 — b=4 , s_q=1（ CFG=4 , 已预热）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0826a17b8c711d0e",
      "translationZh": "0.257 ms（以 CFG=1 作为近似替代）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f3b48b895d4c1f6",
      "translationZh": "稀疏预填充前向计算 — s_q=512 , s_kv=8192",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b453cbb32966b255",
      "translationZh": "稠密解码 — H=22 , s_q=1 , 4K 缓存（ CFG=4 ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afbfecde15a34306",
      "translationZh": "无等效的 PyTorch 路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f25b754f56a39652",
      "translationZh": "模型级 BF16 缓存解码步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35ec71872a986a74",
      "translationZh": "FP8 KV 缓存，启用 FlashMLA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ce9e30c9d598298",
      "translationZh": "延迟降低 8.0%，缓存内存占用降至原来的 1/1.84",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8514d98cb15acda4",
      "translationZh": "对我的使用场景来说是这样——而且可能很快也会适用于更多人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "499cc4c7f8457aaf",
      "translationZh": "使用模型实际的注意力形状进行前向 + 反向计算：192/128，H=22。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93c01c7199ec6939",
      "translationZh": "稠密 S=1024（时钟频率预热后的运行）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bce8a4466492bdae",
      "translationZh": "稀疏预填充——s_q=512，topk=2048",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc4a43c2c930f5db",
      "translationZh": "在完整模型层面，使用 BF16 缓存的解码性能基本持平，因此我不会将内核层面的数据解读为模型端到端速度就能自动提升 3×。但对于注意力计算密集型工作负载——尤其是长上下文训练和稀疏预填充——差异相当显著。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28ea13166be75f98",
      "translationZh": "哦，另外，如果有我遗漏的其他优化，或者有任何补充能帮助大家立即运行起来，我也很乐意审查 PR。感谢你的关注！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d8f34a72f40c489",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/smashedshanky 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
